    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d145">

                <pb facs="0147" n="135" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg135"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.01/356: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador to the Greek
                        Government in Exile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>), <hi
                        rendition="#italic">at Cairo</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-07-05T19:00:00-04:00">July 5, 1943—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Greek Series No. 5. Your 10, July 3, 6 p.m. and 11, July 3, 7 p.m. In response to
                    Mr. Tsouderos’ request, I was glad to make the following comment on the King’s
                    radio address in reply to a question from the press this morning: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“I welcome these declarations of His Majesty the King of the Hellenes.
                            They constitute a reaffirmation of the devotion of the Greek Government
                            to the ideals of democracy and a reassurance to the Greek people that
                            they shall enjoy the full exercise of the sovereign rights of <pb
                                facs="0148" n="136" xml:id="pg136"/> which they have proven
                            themselves so worthy by their heroic resistance to Axis aggression.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
